Dear Residents,

The Homeowners Association Security Committee wishes to remind all
residents to register any vendor access or maintenance windows with
the community security log system.

Several residents have reported unusual network activity from unregistered
devices in recent weeks. Please ensure your home automation systems are
up to date and that any third-party vendors notify you in advance of
remote access sessions.

If you experience any unexpected device alerts, please contact both your
home security vendor and the HOA security committee at security@hoa.example.com.

Regards,
HOA Security Committee
